{"root":"pli/ms","translators":["sujato"],"title":"The Pit of Acacia Coals: a past life story","html":"<article id='ja40'><header><ul><li class='division'><span class='root'>Jātaka </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Stories of Past Lives 40 </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Ekakanipāta </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>The Book of the Ones </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Kulāvakavagga </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Nests </span></li></ul>\n<h1 class='sutta-title'><span class='root'>10. Khadiraṅgārajātaka </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>The Pit of Acacia Coals: a past life story </span></h1></header>\n<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>“Kāmaṁ patāmi nirayaṁ, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Fine, let me fall </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>uddhampādo avaṁsiro; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>head over heels into hell, </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Nānariyaṁ karissāmi, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>but I shall not do what is ignoble. </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>handa piṇḍaṁ paṭiggahā”ti. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Please accept my alms offering. </span></span></p></blockquote>\n<p class='endsutta'><span class='root'>Khadiraṅgārajātakaṁ dasamaṁ. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></p>\n<p class='endvagga'><span class='root'>Kulāvakavaggo catuttho. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></p>\n<p class='uddana-intro'><span class='root'>Tassuddānaṁ </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></p>\n<blockquote class='uddanagatha'><p><span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Sirimātali dhītara pakkhivaro, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Ratiyāgato mātāpitā ca puna; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Jagatīruha vuḍḍha sukakkaṭako, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Tathā nandakapiṇḍavarena dasāti. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></span></p></blockquote></article>"}
